# Repo-only assets.
#
# `assets/普鲸.mp4` is local material, not the shipped default: the bundled animation the
# plugin actually loads is `assets/opening.svg`. `screenshot-splash.png` is a README image.
# Neither is referenced by code, so keeping them out of history avoids carrying a few
# megabytes of binaries.
#
# Note: these stay in the *published* package, because npm packs `files[]` from
# package.json and never consults .gitignore. Add an `!assets/...` negation there if the
# tarball should drop them too.
assets/普鲸.mp4
assets/screenshot-splash.png
